    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345040/extras/e277e3673b39b4f13620172f2b010e03.avif?t=1749409778\" width=800 height=212 /></span><i>The Garden of Forking Paths</i> is a Sokoban puzzle game built on optical illusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world awaits you to bring back the colors to this fairy-tale-like story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Garden of Forking Paths&quot; is an eternal story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is based on time, which has no identity and absoluteness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of this fact, you can find the game <strong><i><u>I</u></i></strong> have created. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can join <strong><i><u>me</u></i></strong> together in creating this game.</p>",
